  "description": "Juyeon has a big concern these days. Her dad who is a famous antique appraiser left home and fences and gang members break into his shop trying to steal everything he owns. Then, suddenly a man named Doggabi appears and says that he will protect Juyeon from any danger if she signs a contract with him. Juyeon reluctantly signs the contract but after that, she starts hearing the voices of antiques whenever Doggabi is near her. Juyeon, a girl who must find one special treasure to protect her father’s shop, starts living with this mysterious man named Doggabi.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/52925464), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/comic/ep_list/my_love_g), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/dotgabi), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=4631398), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000057566), [Comico](https://www.comico.kr/comic/9551)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Indonesian](https://id.kakaowebtoon.com/content/My-Love-Doggabi/441), [S.Chinese](https://manga.bilibili.com/detail/mc27772)",
